/Title (Thermal Camera Reliability Study: FLIR One Pro)
/Subject (The purpose of the effort described herein is to verify the reliability of the FLIR One Pro Gen 3 \(FLIR One\) unit through systematic experiments that compare the temperature perceived by the unit to the temperature measured by contact sensors on different materials through a range of temperatures.)
/Filename (/pdf/TRECMS/AD1149239.pdf)
